msgstr "Uložiť pravidlo"

#: plugins/automation_rules/templates/automation_rules.html:180
#| msgid "Sensor Notification"
msgid "Save this rule and its conditions."
msgstr "Uložiť toto pravidlo a jeho podmienky."

#: plugins/automation_rules/templates/automation_rules.html:182
msgid ""
"Evaluate the saved rule once and record the result without sending "
"notifications."
msgstr ""
"Vyhodnotiť uložené pravidlo raz a zaznamenať výsledok bez posielania "
"oznámení."

#: plugins/automation_rules/templates/automation_rules.html:182
#| msgid "Test started for"
msgid "Test saved rule"
msgstr "Test uložených pravidiel"

#: plugins/automation_rules/templates/automation_rules.html:183
msgid "Send a real test message through the enabled notification channels?"
msgstr "Poslať skutočnú testovaciu správu cez povolené kanály oznámenia?"

#: plugins/automation_rules/templates/automation_rules.html:183
msgid ""
"Send one real test message through every notification channel currently "
"enabled in this rule. Conditions and delays are ignored."
msgstr ""
"Poslať jednu testovaciu správu cez všetky kanály notifikácií, ktoré sú v "
"tomto pravidle aktuálne povolené. Podmienky a oneskorenie sú ignorované."

#: plugins/automation_rules/templates/automation_rules.html:183
#| msgid "System notifications"
msgid "Test notifications"
msgstr "Test oznámenia"

#: plugins/automation_rules/templates/automation_rules.html:185
msgid "Acknowledge and unlock incident"
msgstr "Potvrdiť a odomknúť incident"

#: plugins/automation_rules/templates/automation_rules.html:185
msgid ""
"Acknowledge and unlock this incident? Outputs and settings changed by its "
"actions are not restored automatically."
msgstr ""
"Potvrdiť a odomknúť tento incident? Výstupy a nastavenia zmenené jeho "
"akciami nie sú automaticky obnovené."

#: plugins/automation_rules/templates/automation_rules.html:185
msgid ""
"Acknowledge this incident and allow the rule to create a new incident later."
msgstr "Uznať tento incident a nechať pravidlo neskôr vytvoriť nový incident."

#: plugins/automation_rules/templates/automation_rules.html:186
#| msgid "Delete All users"
msgid "Delete this rule?"
msgstr "Zmazať toto pravidlo?"

#: plugins/automation_rules/templates/automation_rules.html:186
msgid "Permanently delete this automation rule."
msgstr "Toto pravidlo automatizácie trvalo zmazať."

#: plugins/automation_rules/templates/automation_rules.html:192
#| msgid "Wind Monitor"
msgid "Action history"
msgstr "História akcií"

#: plugins/automation_rules/templates/automation_rules.html:195
msgid "Permanently remove all Automation Rules action history."
msgstr "Trvalo odstrániť všetku históriu akcií automatizačných pravidiel."

#: plugins/automation_rules/templates/automation_rules.html:195
#: plugins/irrigation_safety/templates/irrigation_safety.html:229
