msgid "Current Loop Tanks Monitor - Help"
msgstr "Monitor 4 nádrží prúdovou slučkou - pomocník"

#: plugins/current_loop_tanks_monitor/templates/current_loop_tanks_monitor_help.html:8
msgid ""
"This plug-in module measures the water level in 4 tanks. A differential "
"pressure sensor with a 4-20mA/24V current loop (e.g. TL-136) is used for the"
" measurement. If the water level is low, this plug-in stops the irrigation "
"system (stops the running stations in the scheduler) and sends an error "
"e-mail."
msgstr ""
"Tento doplnok meria hladinu vody v 4 nádržiach. Na meranie sa používa snímač"
" diferenčného tlaku s prúdovou slučkou 4-20mA/24V (napr. TL-136). Ak je "
"hladina vody nízka, doplnok zastaví zavlažovací systém (zastaví bežiace "
"stanice v plánovači) a odošle chybový e-mail."

#: plugins/current_loop_tanks_monitor/templates/current_loop_tanks_monitor_help.html:8
msgid "default address 0x48"
msgstr "predvolená adresa 0x48"

#: plugins/current_loop_tanks_monitor/templates/current_loop_tanks_monitor_help.html:9
msgid "Address of the converter on the bus:"
msgstr "Adresa prevodníku na zbernici:"

#: plugins/current_loop_tanks_monitor/templates/current_loop_tanks_monitor_help.html:10
msgid "Adr pin connecting to:"
msgstr "Adr pin sa pripája k:"

#: plugins/current_loop_tanks_monitor/templates/current_loop_tanks_monitor_help.html:11
msgid "GND = 0x48"
msgstr "GND = 0x48"

#: plugins/current_loop_tanks_monitor/templates/current_loop_tanks_monitor_help.html:12
msgid "VDD = 0x49"
msgstr "VDD = 0x49"

#: plugins/current_loop_tanks_monitor/templates/current_loop_tanks_monitor_help.html:13
msgid "SDA = 0x4A"
msgstr "SDA = 0x4A"

#: plugins/current_loop_tanks_monitor/templates/current_loop_tanks_monitor_help.html:14
msgid "SCL = 0x4B"
msgstr "SCL = 0x4B"

#: plugins/current_loop_tanks_monitor/templates/current_loop_tanks_monitor_help.html:15
msgid ""
"The measurement interval sets how often the plug-in reads the AD converter. "
"Longer intervals lower CPU usage and I2C bus load. The plug-in reads only "
"tanks that are enabled or needed by regulation, stop-station or e-mail "
"rules."
msgstr ""
"Merací interval určuje, ako často sa číta AD prevodník. Dlhšie intervaly "
"znižujú využitie CPU a záťaž I2C zbernice. Balíček číta iba nádrže, ktoré sú"
" povolené alebo nutné pre automatizáciu."

#: plugins/current_loop_tanks_monitor/templates/current_loop_tanks_monitor_help.html:17
msgid ""
"Automation Rules can explicitly stop regulation runs belonging to one "
"selected tank or all configured tanks."
msgstr ""
"Automatizačné pravidlá môžu explicitne zastaviť regulácie patriace jednej "
"vybranej nádrži alebo všetkým konfigurovaným nádržiam."

#: plugins/current_loop_tanks_monitor/templates/current_loop_tanks_monitor_help.html:19
#: plugins/tank_monitor/templates/tank_monitor_help.html:21
msgid "How to installing in tank"
msgstr "Ako nainštalovať do nádrže"

#: plugins/current_loop_tanks_monitor/templates/current_loop_tanks_monitor_help.html:21
msgid "Calibration"
msgstr "Kalibrácia"

#: plugins/current_loop_tanks_monitor/templates/current_loop_tanks_monitor_help.html:22
msgid ""
"Without a sensor connected (on inputs 1 to 4), the plugin must display a "
"voltage of 0V."
msgstr ""
"Bez pripojeného senzoru (na vstupoch 1 až 4) musí plugin zobrazovať napätie "
"0V."

#: plugins/current_loop_tanks_monitor/templates/current_loop_tanks_monitor_help.html:23
msgid ""
"When connecting + and - (on inputs 1 to 4), approximately 3.2V must be "
"displayed."
msgstr ""
"Pri pripojení + a - (na vstupoch 1 až 4) sa musí zobraziť približne 3,2V."

#: plugins/current_loop_tanks_monitor/templates/current_loop_tanks_monitor_help.html:24
msgid ""
"We connect the sensor (without immersing it in water, i.e. outside the tank)"
" and see what voltage the plugin shows (example: we will see something "
"around 0.7 V)."
msgstr ""
"Senzor pripojíme (bez toho, aby sme ho ponorili do vody, t.j. mimo nádrže) a"
" uvidíme, aké napätie ukazuje plugin (príklad: uvidíme niečo okolo 0,7 V)."

#: plugins/current_loop_tanks_monitor/templates/current_loop_tanks_monitor_help.html:25
msgid ""
"We will enter this voltage in the plugin settings in the \"minimum voltage\""
" section."
msgstr ""
"Toto napätie zadáme v nastaveniach pluginu v časti „minimálne napätie“."

#: plugins/current_loop_tanks_monitor/templates/current_loop_tanks_monitor_help.html:26
msgid ""
"Then we insert the sensor into a full tank \"to the bottom\" and see what "
"voltage the plugin shows (example: we will see something around 3.2 V)."
msgstr ""
"Potom vložíme senzor do plnej nádrže \"až na dno\" a uvidíme aké napätie "
"ukazuje plugin (príklad: uvidíme niečo okolo 3,2 V)."

#: plugins/current_loop_tanks_monitor/templates/current_loop_tanks_monitor_help.html:27
msgid ""
"We will enter this voltage in the plugin settings in the \"maximum voltage\""
" section."
msgstr ""
"Toto napätie zadáme v nastaveniach pluginu v časti „maximálne napätie“."

#: plugins/current_loop_tanks_monitor/templates/current_loop_tanks_monitor_help.html:28
msgid ""
"In the \"maximum volume\" section, we enter our calculated/actual volume of "
"the tank when it is 100% full of water (example: 50 liters)."
msgstr ""
"V časti „maximálny objem“ zadáme náš vypočítaný/skutočný objem nádrže, keď "
"je naplnená vodou na 100 % (príklad: 50 litrov)."

#: plugins/current_loop_tanks_monitor/templates/current_loop_tanks_monitor_help.html:29
msgid ""
"In the \"maximum height\" section, enter the actual measured distance "
"between the sensor and the maximum level at 100% (example: 43 cm)."
msgstr ""
"V časti „maximálna výška“ zadajte skutočnú nameranú vzdialenosť medzi "
"snímačom a maximálnou hladinou na 100 % (príklad: 43 cm)."

#: plugins/current_loop_tanks_monitor/templates/current_loop_tanks_monitor_help.html:30
msgid ""
"This completes the calibration. The plugin will then recalculate the tank "
"level and volume."
msgstr ""
"Tým je kalibrácia dokončená. Plugin potom prepočíta hladinu a objem nádrže."

#: plugins/current_loop_tanks_monitor/templates/current_loop_tanks_monitor_help.html:31
#: plugins/pressure_monitor/__init__.py:277
msgid "Pressure sensor"
msgstr "Senzor tlaku"

#: plugins/current_loop_tanks_monitor/templates/current_loop_tanks_monitor_help.html:32
msgid ""
"It is powered by 24V directly from this board and does not need to connect "
"any other source! Hard-wiring the input terminal on the board - for example,"
" input 1 + and - will not damage the circuit (board). The maximum current is"
" set to 20mA. For checking, we can leave the unused input connected to + and"
" - (in the plugin we will see the maximum voltage of about 3.5V). Or we can "
"connect an LED of any color between + and - (LED If=20mA)."
msgstr ""
"Je napájaný 24V priamo z tejto dosky a nepotrebuje pripájať žiadny ďalší "
"zdroj! Skrat vstupnej svorky na doske - napríklad vstup 1 + a - nepoškodí "
"obvod (dosku). Maximálny prúd je nastavený na 20 mA. Pre kontrolu môžeme "
"nechať nepoužitý vstup zapojený na + a - (v plugine uvidíme maximálne "
"napätie cca 3,5V). Alebo môžeme pripojiť LED ľubovoľnej farby medzi + a - "
"(LED If=20mA)."

#: plugins/current_loop_tanks_monitor/templates/current_loop_tanks_monitor_help.html:33
#: plugins/water_meter/templates/water_meter_help.html:21
msgid "Wiring diagram"
msgstr "Schéma zapojenia"

