msgid ""
"Direct LAN is recommended and works without Shelly Cloud or Internet. A DNS "
"name such as meter.local is accepted in addition to an IP address. "
"Integrator mode requires an installed, configured and running Shelly Cloud "
"Integration plug-in."
msgstr ""
