#: plugins/irrigation_safety/templates/irrigation_safety_help.html:7
#| msgid "Irrigation state changed"
msgid "Irrigation Safety help"
msgstr "Bezpečnosť zavlažovania nápoveda"

#: plugins/irrigation_safety/templates/irrigation_safety_help.html:9
msgid "Purpose"
msgstr "Účel"

#: plugins/irrigation_safety/templates/irrigation_safety_help.html:10
msgid ""
"Irrigation Safety combines the current OSPy station state with cached Water "
"Meter, Pressure Monitor and tank-monitor values. It never polls I2C or GPIO "
"hardware itself."
msgstr ""
"Irrigation Safety kombinuje aktuálny stav stanice OSPy s uloženými hodnotami"
" vodomeru, tlakomeru a monitora nádrže. Nikdy sám nekontroluje I2C alebo "
"GPIO hardvér."

#: plugins/irrigation_safety/templates/irrigation_safety_help.html:11
msgid ""
"Use Monitor only first. This records and reports incidents without changing "
"outputs. After every station profile has been checked, Active protection can"
" stop all outputs, disable the scheduler and keep the incident locked until "
"an administrator acknowledges it."
msgstr ""
"Najprv používajte iba režim monitor. Systém zaznamenáva a hlási incidenty "
"bez zmeny výstupov. Po kontrole každého profilu stanice môže aktívna ochrana"
" zastaviť všetky výstupy, deaktivovať plánovač a udržať incident uzamknutý, "
"kým ho administrátor nepotvrdí."

#: plugins/irrigation_safety/templates/irrigation_safety_help.html:14
msgid ""
"Each enabled non-master OSPy station has its own expected minimum and "
"maximum flow. When several configured stations run together, their limits "
"are added. A station without an enabled profile prevents range enforcement "
"for that combination instead of guessing a limit."
msgstr ""
"Každá povolená nehlavná OSPy stanica má svoj vlastný očakávaný minimálny a "
"maximálny prietok. Keď niekoľko konfigurovaných staníc beží spoločne, ich "
"limity sa pripočítajú. Stanica bez povoleného profilu zabraňuje vynúteniu "
"rozsahu pre túto kombináciu namiesto odhadu limitu."

#: plugins/irrigation_safety/templates/irrigation_safety_help.html:15
msgid ""
"Startup delay begins whenever the active station combination changes. A flow"
" fault must then remain present for the configured confirmation time before "
"an incident is opened."
msgstr ""
"Oneskorenie spustenia začína vždy, keď sa zmení aktívna kombinácia stanice. "
"Chyba prietoku musí potom zostať prítomná po celú dobu potvrdenia pred "
"začatím incidentu."

#: plugins/irrigation_safety/templates/irrigation_safety_help.html:17
#| msgid "Automatic update"
msgid "Automatic learning"
msgstr "Automatické učenie"

#: plugins/irrigation_safety/templates/irrigation_safety_help.html:18
msgid ""
"Start learning for one station and run that station by itself. Samples are "
"accepted only after startup delay, only from a current Water Meter reading "
"and only while exactly that station is active."
msgstr ""
"Začnite sa učiť pre jednu stanicu a prevádzkujte ju samostatne. Vzorky sa "
"prijímajú až po oneskorení pri štarte, iba z aktuálneho odpočtu vodomeru a "
"iba presne kým je táto stanica aktívna."

#: plugins/irrigation_safety/templates/irrigation_safety_help.html:19
msgid ""
"After the requested number of samples, the plug-in calculates the median and"
" robust tenth-to-ninetieth-percentile range. It expands that range by the "
"configured percentage or minimum margin, whichever is larger, saves the new "
"limits and stops learning automatically."
msgstr ""
"Po požadovanom počte vzoriek plug-in vypočíta medián a robustný rozsah od "
"desiateho do deväťdesiateho percentilu. Tento rozsah rozšíri o "
"nakonfigurované percento alebo minimálnu marginu, podľa toho, čo je väčšie, "
"uloží nové limity a prestane sa učiť automaticky."

#: plugins/irrigation_safety/templates/irrigation_safety_help.html:21
#| msgid "Station count"
msgid "Additional protection"
msgstr "Ďalšia ochrana"

#: plugins/irrigation_safety/templates/irrigation_safety_help.html:23
msgid ""
"Flow without an active irrigation station can indicate a leaking valve or "
"pipe."
msgstr ""
"Prietok bez aktívnej zavlažovacej stanice môže naznačovať netesniaci ventil "
"alebo potrubie."

#: plugins/irrigation_safety/templates/irrigation_safety_help.html:24
msgid ""
"Pressure protection checks that the pressure input is present while the "
"master output is active."
msgstr ""
"Ochrana tlaku kontroluje, či je tlakový vstup prítomný počas aktívneho "
"hlavného výstupu."

#: plugins/irrigation_safety/templates/irrigation_safety_help.html:25
msgid ""
"Tank protection can use fill percentage or water level from either supported"
" tank monitor."
msgstr ""
"Ochrana nádrže môže využívať percento naplnenia alebo hladinu vody z "
"ktoréhokoľvek podporovaného monitora nádrže."

#: plugins/irrigation_safety/templates/irrigation_safety_help.html:26
msgid ""
"Missing or stale data is treated as a separate safety fault while irrigation"
" is active."
msgstr ""
"Chýbajúce alebo zastarané dáta sú považované za samostatnú bezpečnostnú "
"chybu počas aktívnej zavlažovania."

#: plugins/irrigation_safety/templates/irrigation_safety_help.html:29
#| msgid "Sensor Notification"
msgid "Incidents and actions"
msgstr "Incidenty a akcie"

#: plugins/irrigation_safety/templates/irrigation_safety_help.html:30
msgid ""
"A confirmed incident is written to bounded history before notifications are "
"sent. In Active protection, output shutdown and scheduler disabling happen "
"before e-mail or push delivery."
msgstr ""
"Potvrdený incident je zapísaný do obmedzenej histórie pred odoslaním "
"oznámenia. V aktívnej ochrane dochádza k vypnutiu výstupu a vypnutiu "
"plánovača pred doručením e-mailu alebo push."

#: plugins/irrigation_safety/templates/irrigation_safety_help.html:31
msgid ""
"A locked incident continuously prevents irrigation outputs from remaining "
"active. It can be acknowledged only after every associated fault condition "
"has returned to normal. Acknowledgement never enables the scheduler again."
msgstr ""
"Uzamknutý incident neustále bráni zavlažovacím výstupom zostať aktívny. Je "
"možné ho potvrdiť až potom, čo sa každá súvisiaca porucha vráti do normálu. "
"Potvrdenie už nikdy neaktivuje plánovač."

#: plugins/irrigation_safety/templates/irrigation_safety_help.html:32
msgid ""
"Temporary bypass suppresses control actions for a bounded time but keeps "
"monitoring, history and notifications active. It expires automatically."
msgstr ""
"Dočasný bypass potláča riadiace akcie na obmedzenú dobu, ale udržuje "
"monitorovanie, históriu a oznámenie aktívne. Automaticky vyprší."

#: plugins/irrigation_safety/templates/irrigation_safety_help.html:34
#| msgid "E-mail Notifications - help"
msgid "Notifications and live page"
msgstr "Oznámenie a živá stránka"

#: plugins/irrigation_safety/templates/irrigation_safety_help.html:35
msgid ""
"E-mail uses the running E-mail Notifications SSL or E-mail Notifications "
"plug-in. Mobile push uses OSPy Mobile API push delivery and its Automation "
"notification category. Delivery runs outside the safety evaluation worker."
msgstr ""
"E-mail používa bežiaci balíček E-mail Notifications SSL alebo E-mail "
"Notifications. Mobilný push využíva OSPy Mobile API push delivery a jeho "
"kategóriu automatické oznámenia. Doručenie prebieha mimo pracovníka (loop) "
"pre hodnotenie bezpečnosti."

#: plugins/irrigation_safety/templates/irrigation_safety_help.html:36
msgid ""
"The overview reloads current measurements, stations, learning progress, "
"incidents and history in the background. The page does not need to be "
"refreshed."
msgstr ""
"Prehľad na pozadí znovu načíta aktuálne merania, stanice, pokrok v učení, "
"udalosti a histórii. Stránku nie je potrebné obnovovať."

