"The plugin uses Python paho-mqtt for running in OSPy. If paho-mqtt is not "
"available on the system, install python3-paho-mqtt from apt or use the "
"Install libraries button in the plugin settings."
msgstr ""
"Balíček používa Python paho-mqtt na spustenie v OSPy. Ak paho-mqtt nie je v "
"systéme dostupný, nainštalujte python3-paho-mqtt z apt alebo použite "
"tlačidlo inštalovať knižnicu v nastavení balíka."

#: plugins/mqtt/templates/mqtt_help.html:87
msgid "QoS Publisher"
msgstr "Vydávateľ QOS"

#: plugins/mqtt/templates/mqtt_help.html:88
msgid "0: at most once. Will send a message only once."
msgstr "0: maximálne raz. Správu pošle iba raz."

#: plugins/mqtt/templates/mqtt_help.html:89
msgid ""
"1: at least once. Will send a message at least once as long as an "
"acknowledgement is received or the command to end the transmission is "
