#: plugins/rs485_communication/templates/rs485_communication.html:169
msgid ""
"The scan first tries address 255 and the likely factory address 1 with "
"longer timeouts, Modbus functions 03 and 04, one and two registers, 8N1, 8E1"
" and 8O1. It then scans addresses 1 to 254 with function 03 and one or two "
"registers at 1200, 2400, 4800, 9600, 19200, 38400, 57600 and 115200 baud. "
"With no responding device it can take about 13 minutes. Normal RS485 "
"requests are paused for the duration of the scan."
msgstr ""
"Sken najprv skúša adresu 255 a pravdepodobnú továrenskú adresu 1 s dlhšími "
"časovými limitmi, Modbus funkcie 03 a 04, jeden a dva registre, 8N1, 8E1 a "
"8O1. Potom skenuje adresy 1 až 254 s funkciou 03 a jeden alebo dva registre "
"na 1200, 2400, 4800, 9600, 19200, 38400, 57600 a 115200 baud. Bez "
"zodpovedajúceho zariadenia môže trvať asi 13 minút. Bežné požiadavky RS485 "
"sú pozastavené počas skenovania."

#: plugins/rs485_communication/templates/rs485_communication.html:173
