msgstr "RS485 komunikácia - nápoveda"

#: plugins/rs485_communication/templates/rs485_communication_help.html:32
msgid ""
"This plug-in provides one shared RS485 serial interface for OSPy and other "
"plug-ins. It is designed primarily for the Waveshare industrial USB TO RS485"
" (B) adapter with the CH343G USB chip."
msgstr ""
"Tento balíček poskytuje jedno zdieľané sériové rozhranie RS485 pre OSPy a "
"ďalšie balíčky. Je navrhnutý predovšetkým pre priemyselný USB - RS485 "
"adaptér Waveshare s USB čipom CH343G."

#: plugins/rs485_communication/templates/rs485_communication_help.html:34
msgid "Waveshare industrial USB to RS485 adapter"
msgstr "Priemyselný USB adaptér Waveshare na RS485"

#: plugins/rs485_communication/templates/rs485_communication_help.html:35
msgid ""
"The adapter uses a WCH CH343G USB interface and an SP485EEN RS485 "
"transceiver. It converts USB to a two-way, half-duplex RS485 connection and "
"controls the transmit/receive direction automatically in hardware."
msgstr ""
"Adaptér využíva USB rozhranie WCH CH343G a prijímač SP485EEN RS485. Prevádza"
" USB na obojsmerné, poloduplexné pripojenie RS485 a automaticky riadi smer "
"vysielania/príjmu."

#: plugins/rs485_communication/templates/rs485_communication_help.html:37
msgid ""
"RS485 terminals: A+, B- and GND; USB-A host connection and 5 V USB power."
msgstr ""
"Svorky RS485: A+, B- a GND; USB-A konektor. 5V napájanie sa nevyužíva."

#: plugins/rs485_communication/templates/rs485_communication_help.html:38
msgid "Supported communication speed: 300 baud to 3 Mbps."
msgstr "Podporovaná rýchlosť komunikácie: 300 baud až 3 Mbps."

#: plugins/rs485_communication/templates/rs485_communication_help.html:39
msgid ""
"Approximate RS485 reach: up to 1.2 km at a suitably low speed and with "
"correct bus wiring."
msgstr ""
"Približný dosah RS485 je až 1,2 km pri vhodne nízkej rýchlosti as vhodným "
"zapojením na zbernici."

#: plugins/rs485_communication/templates/rs485_communication_help.html:40
msgid ""
"Point-to-multipoint operation for up to 32 nodes; a repeater is recommended "
"by the vendor for 16 or more nodes."
msgstr ""
"Multipoint spojenie až pre 32 zariadení. Výrobca odporúča opakovač pre 16 a "
"viac zariadení na RS485."

#: plugins/rs485_communication/templates/rs485_communication_help.html:41
msgid ""
"Automatic direction control, built-in 120 ohm matching resistor, resettable "
"fuse, TVS surge protection and ESD protection."
msgstr ""
"Automatické riadenie smeru, vstavaný 120 ohmový rezistor so zodpovedajúcim "
"napätím, resetovateľná poistka, prepäťová ochrana TVS a ochrana proti ESD."

#: plugins/rs485_communication/templates/rs485_communication_help.html:42
msgid "PWR, TXD and RXD LEDs indicate power and communication activity."
msgstr "LED diódy PWR, TXD a RXD indikujú napájanie a komunikačnú aktivitu."

#: plugins/rs485_communication/templates/rs485_communication_help.html:44
msgid "Product information and specifications on RPishop.cz"
msgstr "Informácie o produkte a špecifikácie na RPishop.cz"

#: plugins/rs485_communication/templates/rs485_communication_help.html:60
msgid "Connect the USB adapter to the Raspberry Pi."
msgstr "Pripojte USB adaptér k Raspberry Pi."

#: plugins/rs485_communication/templates/rs485_communication_help.html:61
msgid "Connect RS485 A+ to A / D+ / 485+ of the target device."
msgstr "Pripojte RS485 A+ k A / D+ / 485+ cieľového zariadenia."

#: plugins/rs485_communication/templates/rs485_communication_help.html:62
msgid "Connect RS485 B- to B / D- / 485- of the target device."
msgstr "Pripojte RS485 B- k B / D- / 485- cieľového zariadenia."

#: plugins/rs485_communication/templates/rs485_communication_help.html:63
msgid ""
"Connect GND when required by the installation and the target device "
"documentation."
msgstr ""
"Pripojte GND, keď to vyžaduje inštalácia a dokumentácia cieľového "
"zariadenia."

#: plugins/rs485_communication/templates/rs485_communication_help.html:66
#| msgid "Clear selection"
msgid "Port selection"
msgstr "Výber portu"

#: plugins/rs485_communication/templates/rs485_communication_help.html:67
msgid ""
"The default value auto searches specifically for a WCH CH343G adapter. On "
"Raspberry Pi it normally appears as /dev/ttyACM0. You can also enter a fixed"
" path manually, including a /dev/serial/by-id path."
msgstr ""
"Predvolená hodnota automaticky vyhľadáva adaptér WCH CH343G. Na Raspberry Pi"
" sa obvykle zobrazuje ako /dev/ttyACM0. Môžete tiež ručne zadať pevnú cestu,"
" vrátane /dev/serial/id cesty."

#: plugins/rs485_communication/templates/rs485_communication_help.html:70
msgid ""
"The selected baud rate and serial format apply to the complete physical bus."
" All devices connected to the same A/B pair normally have to use the same "
"values. The default 4800 8N1 matches the documented factory setting of the "
"ZTS-3000-FSJT wind sensor."
msgstr ""
"Zvolená prenosová rýchlosť a sériový formát platí pre celú fyzickú zbernicu."
" Všetky zariadenia pripojené k rovnakému páru A/B zvyčajne musia používať "
"rovnaké hodnoty. Predvolený 4800 8N1 zodpovedá zdokumentovaným továrenským "
"nastaveniam veterného senzora ZTS-3000-FSJT."

#: plugins/rs485_communication/templates/rs485_communication_help.html:71
msgid ""
"Saving a new speed changes how OSPy opens the USB adapter; it does not "
"change a slave device. A device-specific plug-in must first send the "
"documented configuration command and then switch the bus to the same speed."
msgstr ""
"Uloženie novej rýchlosti sa zmení hneď ako OSPy otvorí USB adaptér. Nemení "
"to podriadené zariadenie. Balíček musí najskôr odoslať zdokumentovaný "
"konfiguračný príkaz a potom prepnúť zbernicu na rovnakú rýchlosť."

#: plugins/rs485_communication/templates/rs485_communication_help.html:71
#: plugins/rs485_communication/templates/rs485_communication_help.html:75
msgid "Important"
msgstr "Dôležité"

#: plugins/rs485_communication/templates/rs485_communication_help.html:73
#| msgid "Start test"
msgid "Adapter test"
msgstr "Test adaptéra"

#: plugins/rs485_communication/templates/rs485_communication_help.html:74
msgid ""
"The Test adapter button verifies that the USB serial adapter is detected and"
" that OSPy can open the selected serial port with the configured parameters."
" The test intentionally sends no arbitrary bytes to the live RS485 bus."
msgstr ""
"Tlačidlo Test adaptéra overuje, že USB sériový adaptér je detekovaný a že "
"OSPy dokáže otvoriť vybraný sériový port s nakonfigurovanými parametrami. "
"Test zámerne neposiela žiadne bajty na živú zbernicu RS485."

#: plugins/rs485_communication/templates/rs485_communication_help.html:75
msgid ""
"A successful adapter test does not prove A/B wiring or communication with a "
"slave device. A complete RS485 line test requires a responding device or a "
"second RS485 adapter."
msgstr ""
"Úspešný test adaptéra nepreukazuje zapojenie A/B alebo komunikáciu s "
"podriadeným zariadením. Kompletný test RS485 linky vyžaduje zodpovedajúce "
"zariadenie alebo druhý adaptér RS485."

#: plugins/rs485_communication/templates/rs485_communication_help.html:77
#| msgid "Run queue"
msgid "RS485 queue"
msgstr "RS485 front"

#: plugins/rs485_communication/templates/rs485_communication_help.html:78
msgid ""
"All dependent plug-ins should use the public rs485_queue object. Requests "
"are processed in FIFO order by one worker, so two plug-ins cannot transmit "
"on the half-duplex RS485 bus at the same time."
msgstr ""
"Všetky závislé balíky by mali používať verejný objekt rs485_queue. "
"Požiadavky spracováva v poradí FIFO jeden pracovník, takže na poloduplexnej "
"zbernici RS485 nemôžu súčasne prenášať dva pakety."

#: plugins/rs485_communication/templates/rs485_communication_help.html:80
msgid "Synchronous transaction"
msgstr "Synchrónny prenos"

#: plugins/rs485_communication/templates/rs485_communication_help.html:89
msgid "Asynchronous queued transaction"
msgstr "Asynchrónny prenos frontu"

#: plugins/rs485_communication/templates/rs485_communication_help.html:99
msgid "Atomic multi-step protocol"
msgstr "Viacstupňový protokol"

#: plugins/rs485_communication/templates/rs485_communication_help.html:100
msgid ""
"Use call() when one protocol operation needs several writes and reads. The "
"callback runs entirely inside the RS485 worker and remains atomic with "
"respect to other queued plug-ins."
msgstr ""
"Call() použite, keď operácia jedného protokolu vyžaduje viac zápisov a "
"čítania. Spätné volanie prebieha úplne nezávisle vo vnútri pracovníka RS485."

#: plugins/rs485_communication/templates/rs485_communication_help.html:114
msgid ""
"The settings page shows the current queue depth, active queue client, "
"completed/error counters, peak queue depth and the last queue waiting time."
msgstr ""
"Stránka nastavení zobrazuje aktuálnu hĺbku frontu, aktívneho klienta frontu,"
" počítadlo dokončených prenosov alebo chýb, maximálnu hĺbku frontu a čas "
"čakania posledného frontu."

