msgstr "Astro východ a západ slnka - nastavenie"

#: plugins/sunrise_and_sunset/templates/sunrise_and_sunset_setup.html:78
msgid ""
"The selected program that we want to run with this extension does not have "
"to be enabled in the programs, but it must have set days when we want the "
"program to run."
msgstr ""
"Vybraný program, ktorý chceme spustiť s týmto rozšírením, nemusí byť v "
"programoch povolený, ale musí mať nastavené dni, kedy chceme, aby sa program"
" spustil."

#: plugins/sunrise_and_sunset/templates/sunrise_and_sunset_setup.html:79
msgid ""
"If the program does not have a days marked, it will not start (neither by "
"the \"run now\" button in the programs, nor by this plug-in)!"
msgstr ""
"Ak program nemá označené dni, nespustí sa (ani tlačidlom \"spustiť teraz\" v"
" programoch, ani týmto doplnkom)!"

#: plugins/sunrise_and_sunset/templates/sunrise_and_sunset_setup.html:85
msgid "Number of programs"
msgstr "Počet programov"

#: plugins/sunrise_and_sunset/templates/sunrise_and_sunset_setup.html:86
