"If the checkbox is checked, the program will be active even if it is "
"currently raining (rain is ignored)."
msgstr "Ak je políčko zaškrtnuté, program bude aktívny aj napriek daždu."

#: plugins/sunrise_and_sunset/templates/sunrise_and_sunset_setup.html:115
msgid ""
"If the checkbox is checked, the program will be active even if it is "
"currently rain delay (rain delay is ignored)."
msgstr ""
"Ak je políčko zaškrtnuté, program bude aktívny aj napriek dažďovému "
"oneskoreniu."

#: plugins/sunrise_and_sunset/templates/sunrise_and_sunset_setup.html:123
msgid "Program type"
msgstr "Typ programu"

#: plugins/sunrise_and_sunset/templates/sunrise_and_sunset_setup.html:124
msgid "Select program type (sunrise or sunset)."
msgstr "Vyberte typ programu (východ alebo západ slnka)."

#: plugins/sunrise_and_sunset/templates/sunrise_and_sunset_setup.html:132
msgid "Move the beginning of the program"
msgstr "Posunutie začiatku programu"

#: plugins/sunrise_and_sunset/templates/sunrise_and_sunset_setup.html:133
msgid ""
"Enter the time in hours or minutes by which the program should move relative"
" to the selected program type (sunrise or sunset)."
msgstr ""
"Zadajte čas v hodinách alebo minútach, o ktorý sa má program posunúť "
"vzhľadom na zvolený typ programu (východ alebo západ slnka)."

#: plugins/sunrise_and_sunset/templates/sunrise_and_sunset_setup.html:139
