#: plugins/ups_adj/templates/ups_adj_help.html:8
msgid ""
"This plugin checked power line for system. UPS (uninterrupted power supply)."
msgstr ""
"Tento doplnok kontroluje napájanie pre systém. UPS (neprerušovaný zdroj "
"napájania)."

#: plugins/ups_adj/templates/ups_adj_help.html:9
msgid ""
"When a power-line fault lasts for the configured time, the plug-in can send "
"an E-mail and automatically shut down OSPy and the UPS."
msgstr ""
"Keď porucha napájania trvá po nastavenú dobu, balíček môže odoslať e-mail a "
"automaticky vypnúť OSPy a UPS."

#: plugins/ups_adj/templates/ups_adj_help.html:10
msgid ""
"Disable Automatic system shutdown to keep monitoring, logging and E-mail "
"notifications active without shutting down OSPy or sending the UPS shutdown "
"pulse."
msgstr ""
"Vypnite automatické vypínanie systému, aby ste mohli iba monitorovať, "
"zaznamenávať a odosielať e-mailové oznámenia bez vypínania OSPy alebo "
"posielania pulzu UPS pre vypnutie."

#: plugins/ups_adj/templates/ups_adj_help.html:11
msgid ""
"When automatic shutdown is enabled, GPIO 24 - pin 18 provides the UPS "
"battery shutdown pulse through an optocoupler open collector and ground."
msgstr ""
"Keď je automatické vypnutie zapnuté, GPIO 24 - pin 18 poskytuje pulz "
"vypnutia batérie UPS cez otvorený kolektor optočlena a zem."

