#: plugins/venetian_blind/templates/venetian_blind_settings.html:36
msgid ""
"Automatic raising and lowering are blocked while Wind Monitor is disabled, "
"stopped, paused by an RS485 device scan or reports a measurement fault. "
"Pending automatic actions are discarded until Wind Monitor accepts a valid "
"measurement. A safety program started directly by Wind Monitor after sensor "
"failure is allowed to finish."
msgstr ""
"Automatické zdvíhanie a spúšťanie je blokované ak je monitor vetra vypnutý, "
"zastavený, pozastavený skenovaním zariadenia na RS485 alebo hlási chybu "
"merania. Automatické akcie sú zamietnuté, kým monitor vetra neprijme platné "
"meranie. Bezpečnostný program spustený priamo monitorom vetra po zlyhaní "
"senzora sa dokončí."

#: plugins/venetian_blind/templates/venetian_blind_settings.html:36
msgid ""
"Only new accepted Wind Monitor measurements are counted. Strong wind "
"protection operates continuously and starts when the configured number of "
"exceedances occurs within the selected interval. Temperature shading "
"operates only in the configured time window after the required number of "
"consecutive fresh measurements is below the limit."
msgstr ""
"Počítajú sa iba novoprijaté merania z monitora vetra. Ochrana proti silnému "
"vetru funguje nepretržite a začína fungovať, keď dôjde k nakonfigurovanému "
"počtu prekročení v rámci zvoleného intervalu. Teplotné tieňovanie funguje "
"iba v konfigurovanom časovom okne po tom, čo požadovaný počet po sebe "
"idúcich čerstvých meraní klesne pod limit."

#: plugins/venetian_blind/templates/venetian_blind_settings.html:36
msgid ""
"The raising program runs when at least one enabled blind is not confirmed "
"open or does not answer. Temperature shading is armed only when every "
"enabled blind is confirmed fully open. After one lowering action, manual "
"tilting or another partial position does not repeat it; every blind must "
"first return to fully open, whether raised by wind protection or manually."
msgstr ""
"Program beží, keď aspoň jedna povolená roleta nie je potvrdená ako otvorená "
"alebo nezodpovedá. Teplotné tieňovanie je aktivované iba vtedy, keď sú "
"všetky povolené rolety plne otvorené. Po jednom spúšťacom pohybe sa ručné "
"naklonenie alebo iná čiastočná poloha neopakuje. Každá roleta sa musí najprv"
" úplne otvoriť, či už je zdvihnutá ochranou proti vetru alebo ručne."

