#: plugins/water_meter/templates/water_meter_help.html:9
msgid ""
"The plug-in measures pulses from a water meter through a PCF8583 counter at "
"I2C address 0x50 or 0x51. Each uninterrupted one-second measurement produces"
" the current flow in liters per second and liters per minute."
msgstr ""
"Balíček meria pulzy z vodomeru cez PCF8583 čítač na adrese I2C 0x50 alebo "
"0x51. Každé jednosekundové meranie produkuje prietok v litroch za sekundu a "
"litroch za minútu."

#: plugins/water_meter/templates/water_meter_help.html:10
#: plugins/wind_monitor/templates/wind_monitor_help.html:16
msgid ""
"The two I2C addresses are alternatives. If the preferred address is occupied"
" during activation, OSPy selects the free alternative. The settings page "
"rejects an address already used by another enabled plug-in, preserves the "
"previous settings and displays the conflict in a red status bar."
msgstr ""
"Obe I2C adresy sú alternatívy. Ak je preferovaná adresa už obsadená počas "
"aktivácie balíčka, OSPy vyberie voľnú alternatívu. Stránka nastavenia "
"odmieta priradiť používanú adresu iným povoleným balíčkom, zachová "
"predchádzajúce nastavenia a zobrazí konflikt na červenom stavovom pruhu."

#: plugins/water_meter/templates/water_meter_help.html:11
msgid ""
"The overview refreshes live values every second and shows the current flow, "
"consumption in the current minute and hour, total consumption, counter state"
" and a flow history graph."
msgstr ""
"Prehľad obnovuje aktuálne hodnoty každú sekundu a ukazuje aktuálny prietok, "
"spotrebu v aktuálnej minúte a hodine, celkovú spotrebu, stav počítadla a "
"graf histórie prietokov."

#: plugins/water_meter/templates/water_meter_help.html:12
msgid ""
"Local JSON logging and optional SQL logging can be enabled independently. "
"The selected display source supplies the measurement log, CSV download and "
"graph. The interval is specified in seconds, zero maximum records means "
"unlimited history, and zero-flow samples can be omitted."
msgstr ""
"Lokálne JSON logovanie a voliteľné SQL logovanie možno povoliť nezávisle. "
"Vybraný zdroj displeja poskytuje záznam merania, sťahovania CSV a graf. "
"Interval je špecifikovaný v sekundách, nulové maximálne záznamy znamenajú "
"neobmedzenú históriu a vzorky bez prietoku je možné vynechať."

#: plugins/water_meter/templates/water_meter_help.html:13
msgid ""
"When enabled, the Home display shows the current liters per second followed "
"by the equivalent liters per minute in parentheses and opens the Water Meter"
" overview when selected."
msgstr ""
"Po zapnutí zobrazuje na domácej stránke aktuálne litre za sekundu, litre za "
"minútu."

#: plugins/water_meter/templates/water_meter_help.html:14
msgid ""
"Automation Rules can explicitly use the Water Meter provider action to reset"
" total consumption. The action also resets the current-minute and current-"
"hour counters and runs only when live control actions are enabled in "
"Automation Rules."
msgstr ""
"Automatizačné pravidlá môžu explicitne použiť akciu poskytovateľa vodomeru "
"na resetovanie celkovej spotreby. Akcia tiež resetuje počítadlá aktuálnych "
"minút a hodín a spúšťa sa iba vtedy, keď sú v automatizačných pravidlách "
"aktivované živé riadiace akcie."

#: plugins/water_meter/templates/water_meter_help.html:15
msgid ""
"The mobile application receives current flow and consumption cards plus "
"bounded flow history from the selected local or SQL source."
msgstr ""
"Mobilné aplikácie prijíma prietok a spotrebu plus históriu prietoku z "
"vybraného miestneho alebo SQL logu."

#: plugins/water_meter/templates/water_meter_help.html:16
msgid ""
"The PCF8583 count is read explicitly from registers 0x01 to 0x03. After a "
"setup or measurement failure the I2C bus is closed and initialization is "
"retried automatically; the overview displays the current I2C error instead "
"of silently showing only zero."
msgstr ""
"Počet pulzov z PCF8583 sa explicitne číta z registrov 0x01 až 0x03. Po "
"zlyhaní nastavenia alebo merania je zbernica I2C uzavretá a automaticky sa "
"znovu vyskúša inicializácia; prehľad zobrazuje aktuálnu chybu na I2C."

#: plugins/water_meter/templates/water_meter_help.html:18
