#| msgid "Enable program"
msgid "Sensor failure program"
msgstr "Program pri poruche senzora"

#: plugins/wind_monitor/templates/wind_monitor_settings.html:135
#| msgid "Run program when the contact is open (releasing)"
msgid "Run program when the sensor fails"
msgstr "Spustiť program pri poruche senzora"

#: plugins/wind_monitor/templates/wind_monitor_settings.html:136
#| msgid "Use pressure sensor for master station"
msgid "Consecutive measurement failures"
msgstr "Počet po sebe idúcich zlyhaní merania"

#: plugins/wind_monitor/templates/wind_monitor_settings.html:138
msgid "Program to run after sensor failure"
msgstr "Program, ktorý sa má spustiť po poruche senzora"

#: plugins/wind_monitor/templates/wind_monitor_settings.html:145
msgid ""
"After the configured number of consecutive failed or rejected measurements, "
"the selected safety program runs once. Further sensor-failure actions remain"
" blocked until one valid measurement is accepted. A bus scan pauses "
"measurement without counting as a failure."
msgstr ""
"Po nastavenom počte po sebe idúcich neúspešných alebo odmietnutých meraní sa"
" zvolený bezpečnostný program spustí raz. Ďalšie akcie pri poruche senzora "
"zostanú zablokované až do prijatia jedného platného merania. Skenovanie "
"zbernice meranie pozastaví, ale nepočíta sa ako zlyhanie."

